---
import { url } from '../config';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About NeonKey and Michael Ream: a tech hub for beginners and builders covering AI automation, homelab, honest reviews and a weekly email.">
  <article class="narrow page-head prose">
    <span class="kicker">About</span>
    <h1>About NeonKey</h1>
    <p class="lead">NeonKey is a tech brand about unlocking: making AI, gear, skills and the week's news easier to use, whatever your level.</p>
    <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
    <p>NeonKey is run by Michael Ream, who has spent years working hands-on in tech: setting up, maintaining and troubleshooting networks and communication systems, and keeping them running when it matters. He holds a certificate in Computer Installation and Repair Technician from the California Institute of Applied Technology and is now studying Computer Information Systems, which rounds out that real-world experience with the wider picture of how businesses use technology.</p>
    <p>Outside of that, he builds. Homelab projects, AI and automation workflows, and remote IT setups for small offices all get built and documented here in the open, so you can see how things actually work, not just the polished result.</p>
    <h2>How NeonKey works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Honest by default:</strong> reviews are never paid placements, and sponsorships or free products are always disclosed.</li>
      <li><strong>Beginner-friendly:</strong> plain language first, details for those who want them.</li>
      <li><strong>No hype:</strong> no guarantees and no made-up numbers.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href={url('/newsletter/')}>Get Unlock the Week</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
